WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.560
Jonouchi!

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:29.370
Yugi!

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.690
Why are Yugi and Jonouchi dueling?

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.040
And what's with those chains tied to the anchor?

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.610
It's a death duel.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.550
Death duel?

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.820
We have less than 4 minutes.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:54.020
If nothing changes, we'll both sink to the bottom of the sea.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.770
My turn.  I draw!

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.650
Meteor of Destruction.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.540
That's a good card, Jonouchi.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:07.470
Use that card to finish him!

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:09.800
Aren't you continuing the duel?

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:16.150
Attack Me!
Last Turn of Destiny

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:34.880
If you want to kill Yugi in a duel that badly, then finish him with that card.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.160
There's no time left.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.500
The duel will end this turn.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:44.010
If you kill Yugi with that card, you will live.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.880
Or else...

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.340
You both die!

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.250
Dammit!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.490
Can't we do anything?

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.000
Jonouchi...

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.890
Big brother...

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:00.220
Brother, we're out of time!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.400
Please!  Somebody stop them!

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.200
Or else, they'll both die!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.400
Don't worry about me!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.400
Help Yugi and Jonouchi!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.410
But I can't let a hostage die either.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.820
That Ghoul!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.310
It's all or nothing.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.260
It's me.  Can you hear me?

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:41.770
Meteor of Destruction deals 500 points of damage to you and 1000 points to him.

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:45.930
Now use that card to finish Yugi.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.770
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:54.110
If you're going to keep the heart of a duelist and resist me...

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:57.780
...then kill your friend in a duel.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.520
And keep that memory forever!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.790
My... memories...

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:11.060
My memories as a duelist...

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.430
That's Duelist Kingdom.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.400
This is the Harpie Ladies' gorgeous ten-cycle combo!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.150
As each turn passes, they transform and become more powerful.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.950
Go, Thousand Dragon!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.380
Thousand Nose Breath!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.520
My most powerful card has arrived!

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.660
Time Magic!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.170
Time Magic!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:58.270
As you promised, I'll take your Star Chips and Red-Eyes.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.750
I play this card!

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.280
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:11.280
I use the spell card Polymerization to fuse it with Summoned Skull.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:15.590
Meteor Flare!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.840
What happened to your momentum, Jonouchi?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.170
Are you done already?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:32.560
Jonouchi, you look good on your hands and knees.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.610
You can't even stand up, you loser.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.820
Stand up, Jonouchi!

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:42.220
Save your tears of frustration after you lose a duel!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.370
Huh?  What?

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:50.730
An amateur really intends to duel Bandit Keith?

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.860
Take this!  Dark Mega Flare!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.670
In the final match, Yugi Muto will face Katsuya Jonouchi.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.040
Bring it on, Yugi!

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:06.540
Jonouchi, you keep the prize money.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.860
Use the prize money for Shizuka's operation.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.950
Thank you.

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.060
Will you duel me again sometime?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:24.330
Yeah!  Insect Queen is destroyed!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.100
My Queen!

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:34.470
Well done, Jonouchi.  I lose.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.140
I'll treasure this card!

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.220
You better!

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:42.160
I'll win next time!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.680
I'll be stronger too!

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:48.280
I want to become a true duelist.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:52.190
No, not "want."  I "will" become a true duelist during Battle City.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:07:01.860
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.800
My... memories...

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:05.770
Kill him!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.540
Kill him!

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.770
Kill Yugi!

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:20.350
Gain the memory of killing your friend to achieve victory, Jonouchi!

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:23.000
Kill him!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:27.520
Be quiet!  I don't want that memory carved into my heart!

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:28.860
Jonouchi!

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.220
Silence!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:33.360
All you need to do is obey me!

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.820
Finish Yugi now!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:45.360
Jonouchi, you're fighting against Marik's mind control with all your strength.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:48.710
You're trying to get back to normal.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:49.850
But...

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.100
We don't have time.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.430
But I won't let you die.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:00.020
Marik!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:05.100
I know you're watching this duel.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:10.330
I know who's the real loser of this duel.

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:13.550
It's not me or Jonouchi.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.160
It's you, Marik!

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.240
What?

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:27.380
Even if you use your Millennium Item to implant horrible memories, Jonouchi will never give in!

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.120
Jonouchi defeated you!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.360
There's one minute left in the duel.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:41.530
I promise to return Jonouchi to normal before then!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.050
Yugi...

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.540
When that happens, even if we both get dragged into the ocean and die...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:54.210
...Marik, your defeat will be carved into your memories forever!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.790
How dare that vessel!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.280
What's Yugi trying to do?

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.380
Yugi!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.820
Big brother...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.100
Jonouchi... Yugi...

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.030
Let's compete, Marik!

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:15.370
Which will be first?  Do I return Jonouchi to normal or do you drop my life points to 0?

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.030
There's no time left!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:20.370
Attack me, Marik!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:26.140
Fine.  I'll kill you with Meteor of Destruction, Yugi!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:28.240
No...

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:31.450
Silence!  I don't need you anymore!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.550
I'm taking over your body!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.020
Die, Yugi!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.900
Meteor of Destruction!

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.840
This is the end!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.450
Yugi...

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.180
Don't die, Yugi!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.650
Jonouchi!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.200
What?  Impossible!

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:19.660
I completely overtook his soul, but he's back?

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.070
Yugi!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:28.500
You're back to yourself, Jonouchi!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.970
I flip over my set card!

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.080
Mystical Refpanel!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:42.180
This Counter Trap activates when you activate a spell card.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:46.920
Mystical Refpanel absorbs the spell and controls it.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.100
Yugi...

00:10:55.560 --> 00:11:00.000
Due to Mystical Refpanel's effect, Meteor of Destruction is under Yugi's control.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.000
Yugi can decide who to strike.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:07.030
He can strike Jonouchi-

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.060
Or he can strike himself!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.150
There's no time.  What's taking so long?

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.090
Why are we fighting?

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.860
Jonouchi, it's fine.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.970
Our battle is over.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:31.030
Over?

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:36.590
I truly believe that we weren't fighting against each other in this duel.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.920
You fought against Marik inside your heart.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.600
And I wanted to use my strength to protect our friendship.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:46.050
I fought against myself!

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.770
And we both won!

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:08.170
Yugi...

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.080
What's taking so long?

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:28.520
What?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.160
I have one chance!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.400
The goddess of dueling, let there be no luck in this draw!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.970
Forgive me!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:43.760
How dare you!

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.220
I won't let you!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.620
Anzu!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.160
Everyone!

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.460
Thanks, Mokuba.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:10.280
You helped me, too.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.800
Let's save them!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:12.420
Yeah!

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.810
Unfortunately, my draw was too good.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.380
Big brother...

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:31.120
I played Mystical Refpanel because I wanted some time to say everything I want for the last time.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.470
Last time?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:40.930
Jonouchi, you're a dear friend who taught me that I wasn't alone and gave me courage.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:42.930
Yugi...

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.760
Jonouchi...

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:49.620
I love you.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.100
Yugi!

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:56.280
Mystical Refpanel, I'm the target for Meteor of Destruction!

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:01.750
Yugi!

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:05.790
Yugi!

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:32.180
Jonouchi, the detonator has started.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.180
30 seconds left...

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.690
Take the key and escape while you can.

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.680
Hurry.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:43.090
Before the anchor drops into the ocean.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.450
Don't be stupid!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.930
I can't leave you behind!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:53.930
My deck, thank you for fighting alongside me.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:58.000
What should I do?

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:03.260
I know!  Meteor of Destruction has another effect.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:08.520
When it strikes a player, his monster can be forced to attack.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.880
Red-Eyes, attack me!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.190
Lower my life points to 0 with Black Fireball!

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.800
Thanks, Red-Eyes.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:37.880
Yugi!  I won't let you die!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:59.420
I don't have time to grab my key!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.470
Big brother!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.740
I hope I'm not too late!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.160
Jonouchi!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:25.390
Honda!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.130
No!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.130
Yugi!  Jonouchi!

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:38.920
Yugi!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:47.710
Jonouchi...

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:50.520
I'm sorry, Yugi.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.460
And thank you.

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:55.490
Yugi!

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:56.560
Yugi!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.430
Are you okay?  Hang in there!

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:02.860
Where's Jonouchi?

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:05.500
The key for his leg shackles!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.670
Mokuba, give me the key!  I'll go!

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.970
His key won't work.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.000
Can't breathe...

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.330
Am I going to die?

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.330
Is that Yugi?

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.330
He's coming back?  What a fool.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.410
Jonouchi!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.310
Shizuka...

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:56.320
They brought me here.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:57.980
Jonouchi!

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.820
Yugi!  Everyone!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:06.830
He couldn't grab his key because it was more imporant to take off his Duel Disk.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.830
I'm amazed by his stupidity.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.330
He's leveled up to an ordinary duelist.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:21.040
Yugi, I...

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.960
I'm sorry!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.120
It's fine, Jonouchi.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.450
But I was so horrible to you!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:30.740
We both saved what's precious to us.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.120
And that's it.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.080
You're wrong!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:40.190
I don't remember the beginning because I was totally under his control.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.660
But my senses gradually returned.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:49.030
I knew what I was doing, but...

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:52.040
I couldn't stop myself!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.450
Jonouchi...

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.680
I can't forgive myself.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:59.350
I'm a failure as a duelist!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.910
Stop acting like a child!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.850
You can give up your duelist's pride that easily?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:12.360
At Duelist Kingdom, you fought hard to win for your sister.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:17.200
You're fine with throwing away all those memories?

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:20.620
Shizuka saw how pathetic I was!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.720
I've failed as a brother!

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.470
I'm finished!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.470
Stop pitying yourself!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:31.480
Shizuka came here to give you courage!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.100
Shizuka, your eyes...

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:40.050
You gave me more than enough courage already.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:48.060
The first thing I saw when I removed my bandages was you risking your life to save Yugi.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:49.510
Shizuka...

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:54.650
I used to be so far away, but I'm now standing right next to you.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:59.270
Because your friends helped me.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.640
I finally found you.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.670
Yugi...

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.390
This is yours.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:30.620
Yugi, thanks for risking your life to save me.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:37.180
For a fool that tried to throw a treasure known as friendship into the ocean.

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:41.910
My other self, both Jonouchi and I won.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:46.950
Jonouchi is free of Marik's mind control.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:55.550
Partner, you also taught me that kindness has the power to overcome anything.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:59.950
A day will come when you surpass me.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.230
On that day...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.660
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:08.760
Kaiba!

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:15.550
Tell the other Yugi that you showed me your "answer."

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:16.960
Kaiba...

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:22.290
I'll be waiting at the Battle City Finals!

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:25.150
Battle City Finals...

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:29.730
The battle for the God Cards will finally begin!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.620
I will defeat Marik!

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:47.080
The dark side of Bakura learns that Marik failed to kill Yugi.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:52.400
To achieve his goal, he sneaks out of the hospital to enter the Battle City Finals.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:57.240
Bakura challenges Ghost Kotsuzuka to a duel for his Puzzle Cards.

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:03.640
Since they both use ghost and occult cards, this duel is too frightening!

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:07.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Ghost Deck vs Occult Deck

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.800
Duel, standby!

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:27.730
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:33.110
I feel like I've been here

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:42.760
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:54.270
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:57.160 --> 00:23:01.800
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:02.460 --> 00:23:07.070
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:12.180
Will never change

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:17.450
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:22.660
To be who I am

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:27.890
I've kept searching for something

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:32.600
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:35.540
I learned that's the answer

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:42.640
From now until forever...
